    description: "DEEP bakeoff: TCA has 492 send() calls misresolved to TestStore.send instead of Store.send (4 overloads at Store.swift:168-290). All send symbols are functions (not methods), so qualified name registration (AMB-METHOD fix) doesn't help. Root cause: NameResolver picks first match when multiple symbols share a name. Fix requires receiver type tracking through variable declarations. Analogous to Go method resolution (WI-hikug). Impact: 493 misrouted call edges pollute forward slices with test infrastructure."  # eae5
    fields: {}  # eae5
