  message: "Fixed in PR #2595. Receiver type tracking via var_types dict built from property_declaration nodes. Type-qualified lookup (TypeName.method) in local_symbols and global_symbols before resolver fallback. Fixes 493 misrouted send() edges in TCA repos. Confidence: 0.72 → 0.90."  # db39
